// ⚠ IMMORTAL AND IMMOVABLE, AND THAT IS NOW LOAD-BEARING - not a flavour choice.
// A grave is the permanent marker of where a king fell and the PORTALS panel flies
// the camera to it on demand, so it must still be standing at the end of the game.
// Three separate things already guarantee it and none of them may be undone here:
//   PHYSICS_RELIC   takes no badness from neighbours and cannot die to a hazard
//                   scent (see isRelic in stimmings_compute.wgsl)
//   ambients 0      no bad/trans fuse of its own, so nothing counts it down
//   not steppable + DESIRE_NOTHING   it never moves and nothing can move onto it
// The old `dropExtraTimeOverride: true` argument used to sit here suggesting a
// CL.RELIC_LIFE_TIME*10 decay. NU_RELIC_PERMANENT_ENT never read that key, so it
// did nothing whatsoever - but comments all over the codebase were written as if
// it did. Removed rather than left as decoration.
NU_RELIC_PERMANENT_ENT("ent_king_gravestone",     {animpckge: "king_gravestone", n:"Gravestone", d:"The death of a king."},  CL.ANIMATION_0FAST, {sync: false, wind: false} );


