//  = = = = = = = = =   THE SUPER AUTO BUILDERS   = = = = = = = = =
//  A super auto builder builds a whole blueprint by WALKING it. It starts on one cell of the
//  blueprint, steps to the next one at full speed (a cell every second tick), and every time it
//  steps off a cell it leaves the blueprint's entity for that cell behind in it. On the last cell
//  of the walk it turns into that cell's entity itself, and the blueprint is finished.
//
//  Each one is three lines:
//      the BUILDER     NU_SUPER_AUTO_BUILDER_ENT - every builder is the same row apart from how
//                      it looks; entity_templater.js says what that row does and why
//      its RELIC       an ordinary action relic whose bad result is the builder: dropped (or
//                      placed), it activates and hatches the builder on its own cell
//      the PROGRAM     SUPER_AUTO_BUILDER_PROGRAM - which blueprint that relic's builder walks.
//                      The activation hands it over as the builder's Trans1 (the blueprint's
//                      slot) and Trans2 (the step to start on - the relic's cell)
//  The walks are the blueprints' build orders (util/all_bps/pathways/, or the default spiral),
//  baked into the storage buffer by util/scruncher.js and src/stimmings_db.js. Every rule is in
//  THE SUPER AUTO BUILDER in src/stimmings_compute.wgsl.
//
//  ⚠ APPEND ONLY, and in this order - builder, relic, builder, relic... - ids are array indices.
NU_SUPER_AUTO_BUILDER_ENT( "ent_super_auto_builder", {animpckge: "super_auto_builder", n: "Builder Enclosure",
    d: "Walks a blueprint out on its own, cell by cell at full speed, and leaves it built behind it. Its Trans1 says which blueprint, its Trans2 how far along the walk it is."} );
NU_RELIC_ACTION_ENT("ent_relic_super_auto_builder",  STAD.ent_super_auto_builder,    
        {animpckge: "rellic_flash_point", n:"Super Auto Builder - Random Crap", d:"Relic for a super auto builder that walks out a Random Crap yard, starting from the middle"},  CL.ANIMATION_0FAST, {sync: false, wind: false} );
SUPER_AUTO_BUILDER_PROGRAM( "ent_relic_super_auto_builder", "bp_randomcrap2887" );



